sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant API as Express API
    participant DS as Drafting Service
    participant AI as OpenAI Responses API
    participant Val as Draft Validator

    Op->>API: POST /api/outreach/:id/draft
    API->>DS: generate(contact, campaign)
    DS->>DS: build deterministic template as fallback
    alt OPENAI_API_KEY configured
        DS->>AI: responses.create(approved context only)
        AI-->>DS: JSON { initial, followup }
        DS->>Val: validateDraft(initial), validateDraft(followup)
        alt validation passes
            Val-->>DS: no errors
            DS-->>API: { initial, followup, source: "openai" }
        else validation fails or API errors
            Val-->>DS: errors
            DS-->>API: { ...template, source: "template", warnings }
        end
    else no API key
        DS-->>API: { ...template, source: "template", warnings }
    end
    API->>API: transitionOutreach(-> draft_ready)
    API-->>Op: draft + source + warnings
